SUMMARY:Wine Dinner Sarasota\, FL
DESCRIPTION:October 15 — Wine Dinner | Sarasota\, FL\nMichael’s On East | 5–9 PM \nExperience Sonoma wine country in Sarasota with a special Gundlach Bundschu wine dinner at Michael’s On East. The evening will feature a selection of wines from our historic Rhinefarm estate paired with a multi-course culinary experience\, bringing together great food\, expressive wines\, and the stories behind six generations of Bundschu family winemaking. Join us for an evening that’s equal parts wine education\, storytelling\, and good old-fashioned GUNBUN hospitality. \nLEARN MORE
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/wine-dinner-micahels-on-east/
CATEGORIES:Wine Dinner,GB on the Road,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GB-Events-Page-Banner-15.png
