SUMMARY:Rhinefarm Afterhours
DESCRIPTION:RHINEFARM AFTERHOURS | 3RD FRI EACH MONTH | 5-8P \nAn evening series dedicated to wine\, culture and community. Each month brings a new wine theme\, a guest host and vinyl sets. Tickets include a glass of our featured wine and a legendary Rhinefarm sunset. Additional wine and food available for purchase. \nFeaturing Ollie’s Pizza for purchase \nDATES: SEP 18\, OCT 16\nTIME: 5-8p\nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery (Tasting Room Courtyard) \nTICKETS: Free for Bacchus Club members / $20pp and includes a welcome glass of our featured wine. This event is family friendly. Free for guests under 21 years old. \nBACCHUS CLUB: Log into your club-linked Tock account to RSVP. If two (2) complimentary tickets do not auto-apply at checkout\, please check your email for a special code or contact us.
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/rhinefarm-afterhours/2026-10-16/
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery\, 2000 Denmark St\, Sonoma\, 95476\, United States
CATEGORIES:Winery Event,Local,Bacchus Club
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GB-Events-Page-Banner-2026-03-05T140724.662.png
