SUMMARY:Schnucks Wine Dinner with Jeff Bundschu // SOLD OUT //
DESCRIPTION:Schnucks Wine Dinner with Jeff Bundschu\nWe invite you to join Jeff Bundschu at Schnucks Des Peres in St. Louis MO on Wednesday October 28th from 6-9pm for a special wine dinner. It will be a culinary experience you won’t want to miss\, delicately paired with exceptional wines and their friendly staff.\n\nFROM THE HOST\nJoin us for an exclusive five-course culinary journey featuring the exceptional cool-climate estate wines of Gundlach Bundschu\, Sonoma’s oldest continuously family-owned winery. The evening features sixth-generation vintner and special guest Jeff Bundschu\, who will share his personal stories\, deep-rooted passion\, and distinctively vibrant approach to California winemaking. As each meticulously paired course unfolds\, you will gain firsthand insight into the unique terroir of their historic Rhinefarm estate\, their sustainable wine-growing philosophies\, and the meticulous crafting process that has defined the Bundschu family legacy for nearly 170 years.\n\nMENU\nGreeter: Gundlach Bundschu 2025 Gewurztraminer | Gundlach Bundschu 2025 Sauvignon Blanc } Goat Cheese Tart with Asian Pear and Star Fruit | Gundlach Bundschu 2024 Chardonnay } Seared Scallops with Green Apple Beurre Blanc | GunBun Pinot Noir 2022 } Smoked Turkey Roulade with Wild Rice | Gundlach Bundschu Mountain Cuvee 2023 } Cocoa Rubbed Rack of Lamb with Plum Reduction\, Sweet Potato Puree and Haricot Vert | Gundlach Bundschu 2021 Cabernet Sauvignon } Basque Chocolate Cheesecake with Blackberries\n\nCan’t make it? Please share with your local foodies!\n\nBOOK NOW
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/schnucks-wine-dinner/
CATEGORIES:Wine Dinner,GB on the Road,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GB-Events-Page-Banner-9.png
END:VEVENT
